      "decision": "Its adaptive variable-row technique was generalized into 97 and lazy preparation in 112/core1. This standalone implementation was not selected: its table gain coexisted with small/Blueprint regressions."
    },
    {
      "trial": 90,
      "title": "Separate visitor storage and stable generic routing",
